  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689504",
      "title": "Outputting HTML Content",
      "lectureOrder": 20,
      "videoOrder": 18,
      "sourceHash": "d7326547b2f7845a5984bf687a3a2b24f4a8738fe8c295e0017bc059b04fb995",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "One other thing you should know about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.54,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "Bindings is that if you decide that you want to output some HTML content, let's say here in the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 15.96,
          "en": "you want to say this is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "Important and you use the strong tags for that to use to get some bold text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "You see that instead the HTML tags are output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 35.49,
          "en": "So when you have HTML code and you want to output that dynamically and want to have it treated as HTML",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "instead of text, then this doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 42.93,
          "en": "Now, let me emphasize that this is a good default behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.96,
          "end": 43.68,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "Because it protects you against cross-site scripting attacks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "If Svelte would automatically treat everything as HTML code and output it as such, then you would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "very vulnerable to cross-site scripting attacks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "Let's say this is a real, maybe more beautiful application we're building and users may enter content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "Now, if that content is automatically executed as HTML code, then they can of course also add some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "script tags in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.78999999999999,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "And for example, throw an alert.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 77.5,
          "en": "Hello.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.28,
          "end": 79.94,
          "en": "Now here, this does not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 79.94,
          "end": 83.08,
          "en": "It doesn't cause any harm because it's treated as text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 83.28999999999999,
          "end": 90.01,
          "en": "Now, of course, you have scenarios where you want to output something as HTML code and have it treated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.01,
          "end": 91.12,
          "en": "as HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.15,
          "end": 97.39,
          "en": "You should always ensure that this output content is sanitized in such cases so that you make sure it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.39,
          "end": 101.43,
          "en": "safe that you can trust it because well does not check it for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.44,
          "end": 107.28999999999999,
          "en": "So you should make sure that whenever you output content as HTML, it's from a safe source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.25999999999999,
          "en": "And it's it was sanitized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 110.25999999999999,
          "end": 117.16,
          "en": "It does not contain any script text unless you want it to have, but really make sure you protect yourself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 117.16,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 117.7,
          "end": 123.67,
          "en": "But if you then know that you want to output this as HTML, you can do so here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 123.85,
          "end": 127.6,
          "en": "When we say description should actually be treated as HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "Then you can just add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "Add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 132.05,
          "end": 134.09,
          "en": "xHTML in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 134.18,
          "end": 138.89,
          "en": "This again is a special syntax picked up by svelte and it tells svelte.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 138.92000000000002,
          "end": 141.68,
          "en": "Well the result of this statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 141.68,
          "end": 148.82,
          "en": "So in this case the value of this variable should not be output as text here, but it should be inserted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 148.82,
          "end": 151.4,
          "en": "as HTML into the Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 151.88,
          "end": 154.85,
          "en": "What this means is that if we now save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 156.2,
          "end": 162.77,
          "en": "And I enter text here that of course still works because it's now entered as a text HTML node, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 162.77,
          "end": 164.86,
          "en": "that still is displayed as text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 165.8,
          "end": 173.03,
          "en": "But I can also now use HTML tags in there like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 180.32,
          "end": 186.32,
          "en": "See, it's not bold because I haven't downloaded the font for this, but it's red, so this is really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 186.32,
          "end": 187.7,
          "en": "treated as HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 187.88,
          "end": 192.2,
          "en": "We could now also do the bad things and run some script code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 192.2,
          "end": 197.45,
          "en": "Here it won't work because we're typing it character by character and it's getting inserted dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 197.45,
          "end": 198.44,
          "en": "into a paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 198.44,
          "end": 200.3,
          "en": "But in other places this would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 200.3,
          "end": 203.42000000000002,
          "en": "That is why you should always be careful about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 203.72,
          "end": 210.11,
          "en": "I will go back and revert this and only output text here because here I really don't need the HTML functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
